{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1098","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Ж-function"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"6 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The length of the longest common prefix of two strings $$$s=s_1 s_2 \\ldots s_n$$$ and $$$t = t_1 t_2 \\ldots t_m$$$ is defined as the maximum $$$k \\le \\min(n, m)$$$ such that $$$s_1 s_2 \\ldots s_k$$$ equals $$$t_1 t_2 \\ldots t_k$$$. Let's denote the longest common prefix of two strings $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$ as $$$lcp(s,t)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Z-function of a string $$$s_1 s_2 \\dots s_n$$$ is a sequence of integers $$$z_1, z_2, \\ldots, z_n$$$, where $$$z_i = lcp(s_1 s_2 \\ldots s_n,\\ \\ s_i s_{i+1} \\dots s_n)$$$. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ж-function"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a string $$$s$$$ is defined as $$$z_1 + z_2 + \\ldots + z_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You're given a string $$$s=s_1 s_2 \\ldots s_n$$$ and $$$q$$$ queries. Each query is described by two integers $$$l_i$$$ and $$$r_i$$$, where $$$1 \\le l_i \\le r_i \\le n$$$. The answer for the query is defined as Ж-function of the string $$$s_{l_i} s_{l_i +1} \\ldots s_{r_i}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains the string $$$s$$$, consisting of lowercase English letters ($$$1 \\leq |s| \\leq 200\\,000$$$). The second line contains one integer $$$q$$$ — the number of queries ($$$1 \\leq q \\leq 200\\,000$$$). Each of the following $$$q$$$ lines contains two integers $$$l_i$$$ and $$$r_i$$$, describing the query ($$$1 \\leq l_i \\leq r_i \\leq |s|$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For every query output one integer: the value of Ж-function of the corresponding substring."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nabbd\n4\n2 3\n1 3\n3 3\n1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n3\n1\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nbbaaa\n5\n2 4\n1 5\n1 5\n3 3\n1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n6\n6\n1\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample case there are four queries:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the first query corresponds to the substring "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and its Ж-function equals $$$2 + 1 = 3$$$;"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the second query corresponds to the substring "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and its Ж-function equals $$$3 + 0 + 0 = 3$$$;"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the third query corresponds to the substring "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and its Ж-function equals $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the fourth query corresponds to the substring "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abdd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and its Ж-function equals $$$4 + 0 + 0 + 0= 4$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1098F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1098/problem/F"}